WEBVTT

00:00:01.208 --> 00:00:03.833
What? I can't always be
the rage guy.

00:00:03.916 --> 00:00:05.291
No, no. I liked it.

00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:06.875
Nail polish? Knee pads?

00:00:06.958 --> 00:00:08.166
I'm starting to think you guys

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:10.041
don't understand
the assignment.

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:11.291
-[can clatters]
-What...

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:12.833
[muffled cheering]

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:14.500
[sighs in relief]

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:17.333
What? Who sent that
projection to Riley?

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.000
-Why would I know that?
-Don't look at me.

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:20.083
[groans]

00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:21.458
-[keys clacking]
-[console beeping]

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.000
What is going on?

00:00:23.166 --> 00:00:25.125
Who is sending
all this positive...

00:00:26.791 --> 00:00:28.125
Joy.

00:00:28.291 --> 00:00:30.083
-I know you're in there.
-[workers gasping]

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.666
-[worker 1] Is that really her?
-[worker 2] Is she really here?

00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:33.166
[worker 3]
Joy from Headquarters?

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.791
The mind police
are on their way.

00:00:34.875 --> 00:00:35.875
[shuts down]

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:37.500
Well, I think we gave it
our best shot.

00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:39.500
Don't listen to Anxiety.

00:00:39.666 --> 00:00:43.041
She's using these horrible
projections to change Riley.

00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:45.000
Joy, I'm doing this for you!

00:00:45.166 --> 00:00:47.166
This is all
so Riley can be happier.

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:51.250
If you wanted her to be happy,
then you'd stop hurting her.

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:52.625
Who's with me?

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:55.333
-[worker 4] Uh-uh.
-[workers whimpering]

00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:57.541
Really? Nothing?

00:00:57.708 --> 00:00:59.208
[Anxiety] Sorry, Joy.

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:02.125
-[screen chimes]
-Yeah! I see you, 87.

00:01:02.208 --> 00:01:03.208
A cat.

00:01:03.375 --> 00:01:05.291
A little off-topic,
but I'll take it.

00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:07.083
Who else? Come on!

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:08.416
What if Riley
is better than Val

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.666
and then Val hates her?

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.875
Or what if Riley is better
than Val and Val respects her?

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.125
-[screens chiming]
-[Joy] Yeah! There we go!

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:16.208
[sighs softly]

00:01:16.291 --> 00:01:20.000
What if Riley is so bad she
has to give up hockey forever?

00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:22.833
What if Riley does so well
that the coach cries,

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.250
and the Olympics call,

00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:27.333
and she rallies
a weary nation to victory?

00:01:27.416 --> 00:01:29.458
Uh, Joy,
reality is also a thing.

00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:31.166
[screens chiming]

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.250
No!

00:01:32.583 --> 00:01:35.583
Anxiety has got you all
chained to desks,

00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:37.000
drawing nightmares!

00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:39.583
But you don't have to
take it anymore!

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.875
Pencils down! Projections off!

00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:42.958
Yeah!

00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:44.416
-Enough is enough!
-[worker cheering]

00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:48.625
[gasps] My projections!

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:50.041
Pillow fight!

00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:51.500
[all laughing]

00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:53.125
[all cheering]

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.625
For Riley!

00:01:54.791 --> 00:01:56.666
-We need to be prepared.
-[screen shatters]

00:01:59.958 --> 00:02:01.416
Oh! No!

00:02:03.041 --> 00:02:04.083
[sighs in relief]

00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:06.208
Okay, it's time to go!

00:02:06.291 --> 00:02:07.458
Yeah, I think so.

00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:09.625
-Bring it on, coppers!
-[Joy] Oh, no, no, no.

00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:12.041
[cop blows whistle]

00:02:12.125 --> 00:02:13.125
-[worker cheers]
-[cop groans]

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:14.750
[cop] Hey, get back here!

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:17.000
Quick! To the Parade
of Future Careers!

00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:18.333
[workers chattering]

00:02:20.291 --> 00:02:21.291
Grab a balloon!

00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:22.875
-[Disgust] Oh, a pastry chef!
-[Joy] Underpaid!

00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:24.250
-[Fear] Art teacher!
-[Joy] Underappreciated.

00:02:24.541 --> 00:02:26.958
-Oh, ethnomusicologist!
-I don't understand

00:02:27.041 --> 00:02:29.041
what that is. Oh!
Supreme Court justice!

00:02:29.125 --> 00:02:30.125
-That's the one!
-I trust her judgment.

00:02:30.208 --> 00:02:31.208
Get back here!

00:02:32.208 --> 00:02:33.958
-[Disgust] Move!
-[cop] They're getting away!

00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:39.333
[chuckles] Yes! Now Riley can
get some sleep.

00:02:39.416 --> 00:02:41.916
[Fear sobbing]
I miss the jar!

00:02:42.083 --> 00:02:43.541
Joy doesn't get it.

00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:45.875
Without our projections,
we won't be prepared.

00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:47.666
Tomorrow's game is everything.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.250
Coach will either
make us a Fire Hawk

00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:52.458
or doom us
to a friendless future.

00:02:52.541 --> 00:02:54.916
I wish we knew what
Coach thought about us.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.708
-[gasps] Her notebook!
-Yes! That's a great idea!

00:02:59.375 --> 00:03:01.250
[Dani] Everything Coach thinks
about you is in there.

00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:04.375
All we got to do is sneak
into her office

00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:05.750
-and read it.
-[Embarrassment whimpers]

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:10.916
[Anxiety] Come on, Riley.
Move those feet.

00:03:11.666 --> 00:03:12.958
She doesn't want to?

00:03:13.041 --> 00:03:14.791
Uh, are we pushing her
too hard?

00:03:14.875 --> 00:03:16.708
We got to see
what's in the notebook!

00:03:16.875 --> 00:03:18.750
It's the only way for us
to know how we can do better.

00:03:27.083 --> 00:03:29.416
Oh, Riley, no.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.958
[whimpers] Oh. Hmm.

00:03:32.125 --> 00:03:34.125
[whispering]
Joy? Come in, Joy.

00:03:34.208 --> 00:03:35.250
[Joy loudly, over radio]
Sadness?

00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:36.333
[muffled]
Sadness, what's wrong?

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:37.541
Why is Riley awake again?

00:03:37.625 --> 00:03:38.833
-Over.
-[Fear screaming]

00:03:38.916 --> 00:03:41.791
Anxiety is making Riley
break into the coach's office.

00:03:41.958 --> 00:03:43.708
-What?
-She knows better than that.

00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:46.291
She will once we get her
Sense of Self back.

00:03:46.458 --> 00:03:48.541
Sadness,
you have to stop her.

00:03:48.708 --> 00:03:50.541
Just don't get caught.

00:03:51.416 --> 00:03:52.416
-Over!
-[radio beeps]

00:03:55.708 --> 00:03:57.708
[♪ tense music playing]

00:03:59.416 --> 00:04:00.416
[door clatters]

00:04:04.083 --> 00:04:05.083
[Sadness] Psst.

00:04:05.916 --> 00:04:07.458
Psst!

00:04:13.375 --> 00:04:15.000
-[distant clattering]
-[footsteps approaching]

00:04:15.083 --> 00:04:16.208
-[door closes]
-[gasps]

00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:21.166
[footsteps approaching]

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:24.500
[lock clicking]

00:04:30.166 --> 00:04:31.166
[breathing heavily]

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.833
[Anxiety and Envy exclaiming]

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.000
[sighs in relief]

00:04:42.291 --> 00:04:44.541
-No, Riley, no.
-[Ennui yawns]

00:04:45.625 --> 00:04:46.625
[yawns]

00:04:49.833 --> 00:04:50.833
Oh!

00:04:58.625 --> 00:05:00.833
[sniffles]

00:05:02.958 --> 00:05:03.958
Why did she stop?

00:05:04.041 --> 00:05:05.708
[gasps] Sadness?

00:05:06.125 --> 00:05:07.625
Ennui! Where's your phone?

00:05:07.708 --> 00:05:09.708
Ooh, la, la, my phone?
Where is my phone?

00:05:09.875 --> 00:05:11.708
Seriously?
This is not happening!

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.166
No, no, no!

00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:15.708
Okay, she's got to be here
somewhere. Find her.

00:05:16.541 --> 00:05:17.541
-Gotcha!
-[books clatter]

00:05:19.958 --> 00:05:20.958
[sighs in relief]

00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:35.375
Sadness.

00:05:35.458 --> 00:05:37.125
[Sadness] Uh... No.

00:05:38.375 --> 00:05:41.500
[sighs] I know Riley
sneaking around feels wrong.

00:05:41.583 --> 00:05:43.666
This isn't who Riley is.

00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:46.250
It's not about who Riley is.

00:05:46.416 --> 00:05:48.750
It's about
who she needs to be.

